vulnerabilities.suggested_fix:
Modify `_checkpoint` to check if the latest `user_point_history` entry has the same block number or timestamp as the current one. If it does, overwrite the existing point instead of incrementing `user_epoch` and appending a new one:

```solidity
uint user_epoch = votingBalanceLogicData.user_point_epoch[_tokenId];
if (user_epoch == 0 || votingBalanceLogicData.user_point_history[_tokenId][user_epoch].blk != block.number) {
    user_epoch += 1;
    votingBalanceLogicData.user_point_epoch[_tokenId] = user_epoch;
}
```
